# Video Files Directory

Place your video files here:
- intro.mp4   - Intro video (plays once)
- loop1.mp4   - Menu loop variant 1 (loops, hotspots active)
- loop2.mp4   - Menu loop variant 2 (loops, hotspots active)
- loop3.mp4   - Menu loop variant 3 (optional, add to MENU_LOOPS in hotspot-config.ts)
- outro.mp4   - Outro video (plays after card click, then navigate)

Video requirements:
- Must have playsinline attribute for iOS
- Must be muted for autoplay to work
- Recommended format: MP4 (H.264 codec)
- Recommended resolution: 1080x1920 (9:16 aspect ratio)
